      "position": [
        128,
        428
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎯 RAG System Overview\n\n**Use Case:** Intelligent document Q&A system\n\nThis workflow enables AI to answer questions using your own documents as a knowledge source, rather than relying solely on its training data.\n\n**Perfect for:**\n- Company knowledge bases\n- Technical documentation search\n- Customer support with product manuals\n- Research paper analysis",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d433f9bc-7240-4ff4-887a-a3d284197102",
      "name": "Sticky Note e8dab852",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        542,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📚 Document Indexing Pipeline\n\n**What happens here:**\n1. Fetch documents from your API\n2. Split text into chunks (1000 chars, 200 overlap)\n3. Convert chunks to embeddings (vectors)\n4. Store in Pinecone vector database\n\n**Run this once** to populate your knowledge base, then again when documents update.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "73579eee-15f8-4a3c-b725-d940898eb18e",
      "name": "Sticky Note e9947b8a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        462,
        556
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 💬 Query & Retrieval\n\n**How RAG works:**\n1. User asks a question\n2. AI agent uses Pinecone tool to search relevant document chunks\n3. Retrieved context is added to the prompt\n4. AI generates answer based on YOUR documents\n\n**Benefits:**\n✓ Up-to-date information\n✓ Source citations\n✓ Domain-specific accuracy\n✓ Conversation memory (10 messages)",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      }
    }
